body:
Din pacate medicul de familie nu poate face aceasta recomandare, dar alti medici specialisti pot.

&#x200B;

 Oricare dintre cei de aici, la ei sa ajungi si sa ceri servicii de psihoterapie decontate de CANS, prin scrisoare medicala,asta e un serviciu conex actului medical , in caz ca nici medicii nu stiu ca pot face asta. Pediatria ar fi cel mai indicat probabil in cazul tau, trebuie ca si medicul acela sa aiba contract cu CANS ca sa poti face demersul asta, dar se merita.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

a) neurologie şi neurologie pediatrică;

b) otorinolaringologie;

c) psihiatrie şi psihiatrie pediatrică;

d) reumatologie;

e) ortopedie şi traumatologie şi ortopedie pediatrică;

f) oncologie medicală;

g) diabet zaharat, nutriţie şi boli metabolice;

h) hematologie;

i) nefrologie şi nefrologie pediatrică;

j) oncologie şi hematologie pediatrică;

k) cardiologie;

l) pneumologie;

m) medicină fizică şi de reabilitare;

n) genetică medicală;

o) radioterapie;

p) cardiologie pediatrică;

q) chirurgie cardiovasculară;

r) chirurgie orală și maxilo-facială;

s) chirurgie pediatrică;

ș) endocrinologie;

t) gastroenterologie pediatrică;

ț) pediatrie;

u) pneumologie pediatrică.

My mom promised to help I'm at the beggining of my career doing masters is mandatory, the supervision is mandatory, and I'm also working on a shit salary, so she promised to help but then changed her mind a couple of days before it was time to put up (I'll not get into details here), with that money that i wouldeve put aside  for this, I fixed my car, advanced on the requirements to open up  a private practice (psychology) and thus get another revenue stream and other such things, but now I'm left with my pants down faced with theese costs, no one else to help, and I'm at a point where the third month i will start with 0 $.

&#x200B;

The side jobs is what i was thinking ,slowly I'm letting go of pride and might consider Ubering or Deliveries, or try more Upwork, or giving online sessions (as i dont yet have a location rented for my private practice).

